he's the most senior member of islamic  state ever to face trial in a u.s court  el shafiel sheikh is alleged to be one  of a group of british men who captured  and murdered western hostages in syria  they were nicknamed the beatles by their  victims a way of shattering the  anonymity of the men behind the masks  prosecution lawyer john gibbs told the  jury the defendant played a central role  in a brutal hostage-taking scheme the  abuse was unrelenting and unpredictable  they seemed to enjoy beating the  hostages  mohammed emwazi nicknamed jihadi john  was filmed carrying out the beheadings  the prosecution say el shaikh was his  accomplice but the defense claimed he  was a simple is fighter lawyer edward  mcmahon said the evidence will be  inconsistent released hostages will tell  a different version of who the beatles  were you will hear different versions of  who is john ringo george you might even  hear of paul another british man  in 2018 al-shaikh and alexander coaty  who has now admitted to being one of the  beatles gave an interview to sky news  despite what the media says that we are  human beings  and  we do have empathy  and also despite what the media says we  haven't been  formally charged or convicted of  anything  journalist james foley was murdered in  syria in 2014.  his mum diane pushed to bring his  suspected killers to the u.s  i'm just kind of incredulous that he's  pleading innocent and only time will  tell  that is the good thing he's going to get  a fair trial it's in stark contrast  obviously to what our son james  endured  bethany haynes the daughter of murdered  scottish aid worker david haynes was  also in court she hopes the trial will  reveal the location of her father's  remains  the dignity and decency of this justice  process is diametrically opposed to the  horrors of a far away land which are  being recounted in court for the  families of el shaikh's alleged victims  this is the culmination of their long  battle to see some semblance of justice  served martha kellner sky news virginia
 

